<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 33.3 bln rupees in repo auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 33.3 bln rupees in repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it accepted 28 bids for 33.30 billion rupees at Saturday's repo auction.</p>
<p>The central bank received 30 bids for 33.85 billion rupees, the RBI said in a statement.</p>
<p>The cut-off interest rate was unchanged at 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>The weighted average rate was 4.9464 percent, the RBI said.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
